    "title": {
      "en": "Validating Key Zones Through Departure, Return and Context",
      "zh": "通过离开、回测与语境验证关键区域"
    },
    "shortTitle": {
      "en": "zone validation",
      "zh": "通过离开、回测与语境验证关键区域"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates validating key zones through departure, return and context using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示通过离开、回测与语境验证关键区域。"
    },
